                        \Leadspedia\Model\InlineResponse200::class,
                        $request,
                        $response,
                    );
            }



            if ($statusCode < 200 || $statusCode > 299) {
                throw new ApiException(
                    sprintf(
                        '[%d] Error connecting to the API (%s)',
                        $statusCode,
                        (string) $request->getUri()
